Port of Guix's kvantum-1.1.5-xdg-dirs-support.patch to the Qt5 style
backend.  The original patch only touches the Qt6 sources
(Kvantum/style/Kvantum.cpp), while the Qt5 engine is built from the
parallel implementation in Kvantum/style/qt5/Kvantum5.cpp.

It makes the engine look for themes in XDG_DATA_DIRS/Kvantum before
falling back to the compiled-in DATADIR, so themes installed by separate
Guix packages (vimix-kvantum-themes, ...) are visible.

Original patch: https://github.com/tsujan/Kvantum/commit/01989083f9ee75a013c2654e760efd0a1dea4a68.patch
Author: Mark Sagi-Kazar <mark.sagikazar@gmail.com>
Upstream declined XDG support: https://github.com/tsujan/Kvantum/issues/210

